{"4620890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bada Boom", "steam_appid": 4620890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BADA BOOM</strong> is an action adventure where players use the rhythm of 4 Drums to command a gang of silly, slightly addicted dudes who find themselves washed up on the shores of a strange land and lead them on their quest for survival also known as beer ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/c3daebd3af6ea524355d3a89546d2e1c.webp?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All dudes have unique characteristics and the role of each dude during battle varies with their class, allowing you to create a unique and well-rounded army to take on the various challenges that await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.poster.avif?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.webm?t=1777013949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.mp4?t=1777013949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your quest you will find different items which can be used to upgrade the dudes in your army ! Hats, Weapons, a Hero with special abilities and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the crew and let there be beer for all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/c3daebd3af6ea524355d3a89546d2e1c.webp?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BADA BOOM</strong> is an action adventure where players use the rhythm of 4 Drums to command a gang of silly, slightly addicted dudes who find themselves washed up on the shores of a strange land and lead them on their quest for survival also known as beer ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/c3daebd3af6ea524355d3a89546d2e1c.webp?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All dudes have unique characteristics and the role of each dude during battle varies with their class, allowing you to create a unique and well-rounded army to take on the various challenges that await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.poster.avif?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.webm?t=1777013949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/1c228ab61861cc769305529a8ea9217f.mp4?t=1777013949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your quest you will find different items which can be used to upgrade the dudes in your army ! Hats, Weapons, a Hero with special abilities and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the crew and let there be beer for all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/extras/c3daebd3af6ea524355d3a89546d2e1c.webp?t=1777013949\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "BADA BOOM is an action adventure where players use the rhythm of 4 Drums to command a gang of silly, slightly alcoholic dudes who find themselves washed up on the shores of a strange land and lead them on their quest for survival aka beer ;)", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/ac11f2c411d3850a7a1a1add99f479e43eb143d9/header.jpg?t=1777013949", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/d03c00d44339598ef6479101b67be6d8d2d21760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777013949", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620890/d03c00d44339598ef6479101b67be6d8d2d21760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777013949", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b